getOob arg index Int64 idxOob
getOob discards "status intentionally unused in this demonstration"
getOob catch oobErr ListError

checkLen is call
checkLen in main
checkLen invokes test.assertEqualInt64
checkLen arg name String tnLen
checkLen arg expected Int64 expectLen
checkLen arg actual Int64 listLen

checkGet0 is call
checkGet0 in main
checkGet0 invokes test.assertEqualInt64
checkGet0 arg name String tnGet0
